- op: discuss  # 1cb4
  at: '2026-03-06T19:54:13Z'  # 1cb4
  by: agent  # 1cb4
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 1cb4
  clock: 3  # 1cb4
  nonce: 1cb4  # 1cb4
  message: "Root cause is not goroutine launch detection (go statements do get their call_expressions visited). The real issue is constructor return type inference: newDisp := dispatch.NewDispatcher(...) doesn't populate var_types because _type_from_rhs only handles composite literals. The fix is to infer type from NewXxx() constructor naming convention."  # 1cb4
